# data.dat column definitions:
# move        : Monte Carlo move number
# time        : CPU time elapsed since simulation start [s]
# U           : potential energy of the current accepted sequence
# U_am        : attention-map contribution to U
# U_structure_ce : structure-token cross-entropy contribution to U (0 if lambda_structure_ce=0)
# Hd_to_ref   : Hamming distance between current accepted sequence and reference sequence
# site        : sequence position(s) proposed this move (0-indexed), comma-separated when n_sites > 1
# cur_aa      : amino acid(s) at the site(s) before this move, comma-separated when n_sites > 1
# proposed_aa : amino acid(s) proposed at the site(s) this move, comma-separated when n_sites > 1
# dU          : U(proposed) - U(current)
# log_a_AB    : log-probability of proposing this move (summed over its sites)
# log_a_BA    : log-probability of proposing the reverse move from the candidate (summed over its sites)
# log_ratio   : log Metropolis-Hastings ratio, -dU/T + log_a_BA - log_a_AB
# accepted    : 1 if proposed move is accepted, 0 if rejected
# acc_moves   : cumulative number of accepted Monte Carlo moves
# acc_rate    : cumulative Monte Carlo acceptance rate, acc_moves / move
#
move	time	U	U_am	U_structure_ce	Hd_to_ref	site	cur_aa	proposed_aa	dU	log_a_AB	log_a_BA	log_ratio	accepted	acc_moves	acc_rate
